_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph (Condition)\">Polymorph</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 20  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You are now a particularly ripe wheel of cheese, unpleasant to the nostril.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Cheese_Wheel\"> Creature: Cheese Wheel </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheese_Wheel\" title=\"Cheese Wheel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Cheese_Wheel.png/120px-Portrait_Cheese_Wheel.png.webp, /w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Cheese_Wheel.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Cheese_Wheel.png/120px-Portrait_Cheese_Wheel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Cheese_Wheel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheese_Wheel\" title=\"Cheese Wheel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>10</span></b></div> \n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>10</span></b></div> \n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>10</span></b></div> \n</td>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>10</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/36px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>Tiny</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheesy_Smell\" title=\"Cheesy Smell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/80px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cheesy Smell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cheesy_Smell\" title=\"Cheesy Smell\">Cheesy Smell</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Create a cloud of gas so pungent it prevents creatures within it from taking actions. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/80px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Movement Speed\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Movement Speed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Jump to a destination. \n\nYour <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> affects how far you can jump. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div> </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></